# Upstream reference base

This project is a clean-room, mORMot-native implementation. It is NOT a port of
MakerAI. MakerAI is consulted only as a *conceptual* reference (which features
exist, how an MCP tool registry is shaped) — no MakerAI source code is copied.

Conceptual reference snapshot
  Project:   MakerAI — https://github.com/gustavoeenriquez/MakerAi
  Fork seen: https://github.com/landrix/MakerAi   (branch: fpc)
  Commit:    fbf15c0   (fpc HEAD at time of writing, 2026-06)

Authoritative specifications we build against
  MCP protocol revision: 2025-11-25   — https://modelcontextprotocol.io
  JSON-RPC 2.0                          — https://www.jsonrpc.org/specification

Runtime foundation
  mORMot 2 — shared/delphi/libs/_git_Synopse2

The gitignored _upstream/ folder (if present) holds a local read-only clone of
MakerAI for concept lookup ONLY.
